<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following Brazilian soybean and products basis levels.</p>
<p>(NS - no seller T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount, NB - no bidder)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	     28/25 D	April	   25/18 D</p>
<p> May		 25/22 D	May	     25/18 D</p>
<p> July		14/10 D	July	    15/6  D</p>
<p> August	    15/20 P	August	  15/25 P</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	     19/15 D	April	   15/10 D</p>
<p> May		 19/17 D	May	     21/16 D</p>
<p> July		20/18 D	July	    21/19 D</p>
<p> August	   6.5/3  D	August	   7/3  D</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	     80/70  D	April	   NS/NB</p>
<p> May		 85/70  D	May	    506/510*</p>
<p> July	     130/110 D	July	   506/510*</p>
<p> August	  85 D/NB	   August	  NS/NB</p>
<p>* outright prices in dollars per tonne</p>
